{"title": "沙发上的哲学家", "index": 15, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre\">\n<p class=\"calibre_9\" id=\"filepos151490\"><span class=\"calibre1\">第六章</span></p><blockquote class=\"calibre_17\"><blockquote class=\"calibre_18\">我看到的世界总是比真实的更局限。</blockquote></blockquote><div class=\"mbp_pagebreak\" id=\"calibre_pb_14\"></div>\n</body>"}]}